  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p>Tri Boots is an emerging independent footwear brand focused on craftsmanship, material quality, and long-term wear.</p><p>We specialize in handcrafted leather boots made from full-grain cowhide, designed for men who value durability, comfort, and understated style. Each pair is built to age well over time — not just for looks, but for daily use.</p><p>Our customers are primarily based in the U.S., aged 45+, and prefer timeless designs over fast fashion.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different:</p><ul><li><strong>Real materials, no shortcuts</strong><br>We use full-grain cowhide instead of synthetic or corrected leather.</li><li><strong>Handcrafted construction</strong><br>Each pair is carefully made with attention to stitching, structure, and longevity.</li><li><strong>Built for comfort over time</strong><br>Our boots break in and become more comfortable with wear — not disposable fashion.</li><li><strong>Strong customer feedback</strong><br>Many of our customers come back for repeat purchases and actively recommend us.</li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p>We offer a competitive commission structure designed for long-term partners:</p><ul><li><strong>5%–10% commission per sale</strong></li><li><strong>Performance-based increases</strong><br>Higher commission tiers available for strong affiliates</li><li><strong>Cookie duration: 30 days</strong></li><li><strong>Fast payouts</strong></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us:<br>• Other information:</p></div></div>",
